[FEN "8/1p6/4k1p1/6P1/P3KP2/1R6/r7/8 w - - 0 1"]

1. { -KEY- } Rb6+ $1 { This lets White take the b-pawn with check. } ( 1. Rxb7 $2 Rxa4 { was less to the point. } ) 
Kf7 2. Rxb7+ Ke6 3. Rb6+ $1 { Again displacing the enemy king before taking further action. } ( { There can follow } 3. Rb6 Kf7 4. Rf6 Kg7 5. Ra6 Kf7 6. Kd5 { and the king helps the a-pawn to queen. } ) 

